<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Nov 8, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Nov 8    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 4,930    5,453 10,995</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     136	126    326</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 5,929    6,442 12,627</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,923    2,153   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     345	349   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,583    3,583   unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,851    6,085   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
